---
title: "宝珠奶酪 — 天然酿造更健康"
meta_description: "宝珠奶酪（BOJOO），中国奶酪茶饮开创者。始于2010年，以40天酿造原浆与天然食材，打造健康美味的中式酪饮。全国94+门店，累计服务500万+顾客。"
layout: null
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{{ title | default("宝珠奶酪") }}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="{{ meta_description }}">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <style>
    /* ===== Single Page Hero Styles ===== */
    .sp-hero {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      color: #fff;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .sp-hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0%, rgba(184,134,78,0.4) 100%);
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .sp-hero-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      background-attachment: fixed;
      transform: scale(1.05);
      animation: heroZoom 20s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    @keyframes heroZoom {
      0% { transform: scale(1.05); }
      100% { transform: scale(1.15); }
    }
    .sp-hero-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 800px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
    .sp-hero-content h1 {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      text-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      animation: fadeUp 1s ease-out;
    }
    .sp-hero-content p {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      opacity: 0.95;
      animation: fadeUp 1s ease-out 0.3s both;
    }
    .sp-hero-content .btn-group {
      animation: fadeUp 1s ease-out 0.6s both;
    }
    .sp-hero-content .btn-primary {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border: 2px solid #fff;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      padding: 14px 40px;
    }
    .sp-hero-content .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    }
    .sp-hero-content .btn-outline {
      border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      padding: 14px 40px;
    }
    .sp-hero-content .btn-outline:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      border-color: #fff;
      color: #fff;
    }
    .scroll-indicator {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 30px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      z-index: 2;
      animation: bounce 2s infinite;
    }
    .scroll-indicator span {
      display: block;
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-right: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }
    @keyframes bounce {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(10px); }
    }
    @keyframes fadeUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* ===== Parallax Section ===== */
    .sp-parallax {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 50vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      color: #fff;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .sp-parallax::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(44,44,44,0.6);
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .sp-parallax-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: -20% 0;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    }
    .sp-parallax-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 700px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    /* ===== Data Counter ===== */
    .sp-counter {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-primary-dark) 0%, var(--color-primary) 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 80px 0;
    }
    .sp-counter h2 {
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }
    .counter-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
      gap: 32px;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .counter-item {
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .counter-number {
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: block;
    }
    .counter-label {
      font-size: 1rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    /* ===== Product Gallery ===== */
    .sp-products {
      padding: 100px 0;
    }
    .sp-products h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    }
    .sp-products .subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .product-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
      gap: 32px;
    }
    .product-card {
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
    }
    .product-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-8px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
    }
    .product-card-img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 220px;
      object-fit: cover;
      display: block;
    }
    .product-card-body {
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .product-card-body h3 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .product-card-body .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      background: var(--color-bg-light);
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .product-card-body p {
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* ===== Story Section ===== */
    .sp-story {
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .sp-story-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    }
    .sp-story::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(250,247,242,0.92);
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .sp-story-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: center;
      max-width: 1100px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 100px 20px;
    }
    .sp-story-text h2 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .sp-story-text p {
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .sp-story-text .btn-primary {
      margin-top: 16px;
    }
    .sp-story-img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    }

    /* ===== Store Showcase ===== */
    .sp-stores {
      padding: 100px 0;
      background: var(--color-bg-light);
    }
    .sp-stores h2 {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    }
    .sp-stores .subtitle {
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .store-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }
    .store-card {
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      height: 280px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .store-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      transition: transform 0.5s;
    }
    .store-card:hover img {
      transform: scale(1.1);
    }
    .store-card::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0,0,0,0.5) 0%, transparent 50%);
    }
    .store-card-label {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 16px;
      left: 16px;
      z-index: 2;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }

    /* ===== Franchise CTA ===== */
    .sp-franchise {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 60vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      color: #fff;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .sp-franchise::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(184,134,78,0.85) 0%, rgba(44,44,44,0.85) 100%);
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .sp-franchise-bg {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    }
    .sp-franchise-content {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      max-width: 700px;
      padding: 0 20px;
    }
    .sp-franchise-content h2 {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .sp-franchise-content .tagline {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }
    .sp-franchise-content .info-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .sp-franchise-content .info-item {
      padding: 16px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      border-radius: 12px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
    }
    .sp-franchise-content .info-item h4 {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      opacity: 0.8;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .sp-franchise-content .info-item span {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .sp-franchise-content .btn-primary {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      padding: 14px 40px;
    }
    .sp-franchise-content .btn-primary:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.9);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    /* ===== Mini Program ===== */
    .sp-miniprogram {
      padding: 80px 0;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--color-bg-light);
    }
    .sp-miniprogram h2 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      color: var(--color-primary-dark);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .sp-miniprogram p {
      color: var(--color-text-light);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    /* ===== Scroll Animations ===== */
    .fade-in {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(40px);
      transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s ease;
    }
    .fade-in.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    /* ===== Responsive ===== */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .sp-hero-content h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
      .sp-hero-content p {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
      .counter-number {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
      }
      .sp-story-content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        padding: 60px 20px;
      }
      .sp-story-img {
        order: -1;
        max-height: 250px;
        object-fit: cover;
      }
      .sp-franchise-content .info-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .sp-franchise-content h2 {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }
      .btn-group {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="sp-hero">
    <div class="sp-hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/hero-1.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="sp-hero-content">
      <h1>天然酿造更健康</h1>
      <p>宝珠奶酪 — 中国奶酪茶饮开创者<br>让古代格格的下午茶变成摩登女孩的健康新选择</p>
      <div class="btn-group">
        <a href="#story" class="btn btn-primary">了解品牌</a>
        <a href="#franchise" class="btn btn-outline">立即加盟</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="scroll-indicator"><span></span></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Brand Highlights -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px;color:var(--color-primary-dark);font-size:2rem">品牌亮点</h2>
      <div class="card-grid fade-in">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>始于 2010</h3>
          <p>第一家店诞生于上海田子坊，16 年品牌历史，累计服务 500万+ 顾客</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>40 天酿造</h3>
          <p>中式奶酪用 40 天酿造的原浆与牛奶自然凝结，拒绝氢化奶油、植脂末</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>全国 94+ 门店</h3>
          <p>历史累计 253 家门店，覆盖全国核心商圈</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>本真味道</h3>
          <p>本真味道 · 大地食材 · 天然酿造 — 健康、中国、质朴温暖</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Data Counter -->
  <section class="sp-counter">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>数字看宝珠</h2>
      <div class="counter-grid fade-in">
        <div class="counter-item">
          <span class="counter-number">2010</span>
          <span class="counter-label">品牌创始年份</span>
        </div>
        <div class="counter-item">
          <span class="counter-number">500万+</span>
          <span class="counter-label">累计服务顾客</span>
        </div>
        <div class="counter-item">
          <span class="counter-number">94</span>
          <span class="counter-label">全国活跃门店</span>
        </div>
        <div class="counter-item">
          <span class="counter-number">1.94亿</span>
          <span class="counter-label">2024 GMV 峰值</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Products -->
  <section class="sp-products">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>核心产品</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">本真味道 · 大地食材 · 天然酿造</p>
      <div class="product-grid fade-in">
        <div class="product-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/products/1649410272.jpg" alt="酒酿桂花酪" class="product-card-img">
          <div class="product-card-body">
            <span class="tag">招牌</span>
            <h3>中国酪饮</h3>
            <p>代表：酒酿桂花酪<br>40 天酿造原浆 + 牛奶自然凝结</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/products/1649410266.jpg" alt="雪域高原手作酸奶" class="product-card-img">
          <div class="product-card-body">
            <span class="tag">人气</span>
            <h3>手作酸奶</h3>
            <p>代表：雪域高原手作酸奶<br>两步发酵，过滤乳清</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/products/1649410248.jpg" alt="酸奶昔" class="product-card-img">
          <div class="product-card-body">
            <span class="tag">健康</span>
            <h3>酸奶昔</h3>
            <p>新鲜蔬果 + 手作酸奶<br>富含蛋白质与膳食纤维</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="product-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/products/1649407522.jpg" alt="酸奶菜菜" class="product-card-img">
          <div class="product-card-body">
            <span class="tag">经典</span>
            <h3>轻食</h3>
            <p>代表：酸奶菜菜<br>10 年经典产品</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Brand Story -->
  <section class="sp-story" id="story">
    <div class="sp-story-bg" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/hero-2.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="sp-story-content">
      <div class="sp-story-text fade-in">
        <h2>宝珠的故事</h2>
        <p>2010 年夏天，宝珠和周先生在北京胡同里第一次喝到中国奶酪，被深深惊艳。两人白天在写字楼里工作，晚上到小店里酿造第二天的饮品。</p>
        <p>快乐就是酿出本真的味道，做一件温暖美好的事。</p>
        <p>十三年来，宝珠沿着原创之路踽踽独行，将酿造技艺与现代茶饮结合，让古代格格们的下午茶变成摩登女孩的健康饮品新选择。</p>
        <a href="/about.html" class="btn btn-primary">了解更多</a>
      </div>
      <img src="/assets/images/about-1.jpg" alt="宝珠奶酪" class="sp-story-img fade-in">
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Store Showcase -->
  <section class="sp-stores">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>门店空间</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">探索现代的轻松的新中式小歇空间</p>
      <div class="store-grid fade-in">
        <div class="store-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/store-1.jpg" alt="门店">
          <span class="store-card-label">门店环境</span>
        </div>
        <div class="store-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/store-2.jpg" alt="门店">
          <span class="store-card-label">产品制作</span>
        </div>
        <div class="store-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/store-3.jpg" alt="门店">
          <span class="store-card-label">品牌联名</span>
        </div>
        <div class="store-card">
          <img src="/assets/images/store-4.jpg" alt="门店">
          <span class="store-card-label">大地食材</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Franchise CTA -->
  <section class="sp-franchise" id="franchise">
    <div class="sp-franchise-bg" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/hero-3.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="sp-franchise-content fade-in">
      <h2>加盟宝珠奶酪</h2>
      <p class="tagline">全新联营模式，0 加盟费，大幅降低开店门槛</p>
      <div class="info-grid">
        <div class="info-item">
          <h4>单店投资</h4>
          <span>40-50 万</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <h4>加盟费</h4>
          <span>0 元</span>
        </div>
        <div class="info-item">
          <h4>保证金</h4>
          <span>3 万</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="/franchise.html" class="btn btn-primary">了解加盟政策</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mini Program -->
  <section class="sp-miniprogram">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>进入小程序</h2>
      <p>手机扫码或点击下方链接，直接进入宝珠奶酪微信小程序</p>
      <a href="weixin://dl/business/?t=XXXXXXX" class="btn btn-primary">打开小程序</a>
      <p style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#999;margin-top:12px">（小程序 URL Scheme 占位，待从小程序后台生成）</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  {% include "footer.njk" %}

  <script src="/scripts/main.js"></script>
  <script>
    // Scroll-triggered fade-in animations
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
      var elements = document.querySelectorAll(".fade-in");
      var observer = new IntersectionObserver(function (entries) {
        entries.forEach(function (entry) {
          if (entry.isIntersecting) {
            entry.target.classList.add("visible");
            observer.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      }, { threshold: 0.15 });
      elements.forEach(function (el) { observer.observe(el); });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
